# POC-VMS-39 operator runner audit checklist

- Confirm the exact `POC-VMS-39` and cell-specific attempt ID before launch.
- Confirm the freeze manifest binds current protocol, runner, fixture/grader, tests, and protected baseline.
- Confirm the output is a new child of the approved D-volume POC root.
- Confirm the role has no problem, solution, Trace, Tell, Seven, DB, or Redis input.
- Confirm the model is not instructed or allowed to read AGENTS.md after session start.
- Confirm only one cell is launched and no retry-until-visible path exists.
- Before finalize, confirm the pane exited and the exact ATIF grader report was written once.
- Confirm the final bundle retains freeze, fixture, launch, health, intervention, export, model output, grader, and final receipt.
- Treat all results as `DEVELOPMENT_ONLY`; do not infer role qualification or Tell efficacy.
